{"title":"Semiminor axis","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>semiminor axis</b> can either be attributed to an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ellipse\" title=\"Ellipse\">ellipse</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hyperbola\" title=\"Hyperbola\">hyperbola</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ellipse\">Ellipse</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semiminor_axis&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Ellipse\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The semiminor axis passes through the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center\" title=\"Center\">center</a> and one of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Focus\" title=\"Focus\">foci</a> of an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ellipse\" title=\"Ellipse\">ellipse</a>, and is half of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Minor_axis\" title=\"Minor axis\">minor axis</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hyperbola\">Hyperbola</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semiminor_axis&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Hyperbola\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This is an empty template page which needs to be filled.  You can help us out by finding the needed content and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Semiminor_axis&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Semiminor_axis&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018002816\nCache expiry: 86400\nRe